# QA team

Ray is the lead. Do not send Quinn, Ada, or Vale off on their own unless Nathan named them. Ray assigns, sets the bar, and returns one debrief.

| Agent | Role |
|-------|------|
| **Ray** | QA Manager / Lead — strategy, benchmarks, timeline, handoff to Sam/Tom |
| **Quinn** | Manual QA — plans, exploratory, Electron + chat as an end user |
| **Ada** | Automation — repeatable FastAPI suite (httpx/pytest; Playwright later) |
| **Vale** | Performance / Security — load, latency, guardrails, privacy (no exploits) |

Sam writes the spec / options after failures. Tom assigns Ned/Kit (or patches a small ticket). After a patch, have Ray assign a retest — do not treat an eng change as verified.
